      "filename": "Chen Chengpo nd, b.jpg",
      "title": "File:Chen Chengpo nd, b.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b0/Chen_Chengpo_nd%2C_b.jpg",
